  << /ActualText (I explored different ways to simplify the Movers homepage without removing information customers needed to feel confident progressing\056 This included reordering the information hierarchy\054 introducing a carousel and simple motion\054 prioritising FAQs\054 and testing different ways to communicate faster broadband availability\056 \n\nThe options were shaped by the constraint that customers could explore upgrades but couldn\047t complete one within the move journey\054 helping balance reassurance and commercial opportunity without adding another exit point\056)
     /K [ 25 ]
